==In the side series games==
In [[Pokémon Stadium 2]], the player's [[Pokédex]] uses the New Pokédex order by default. However, the New Pokédex numbers are not shown anywhere in the games, with the [[List of Pokémon by National Pokédex number|Old Pokédex numbers]] being used instead.

